SUMMARY:Schmigadoon!
LOCATION:Nederlander Theatre, 208 West 41st Street, New York NY 10036
DESCRIPTION:<p>Tony Award&reg; Winner for Best Musical!<br /><br />Welcome
  to Schmigadoon &mdash; the magical town where every day is a musical.
  Everybody has a song for everything, and the only bridge out of town leads
  nowhere. When one couple accidentally wanders in, they discover the only
  escape is finding true love &mdash; which may or may not be with each
  other.<br /><br />This <em>New York Times </em>Critic&rsquo;s Pick is an
  &ldquo;uproarious, high-energy, delicious sundae.&rdquo; <em>Entertainment
  Weekly</em> cheers, &ldquo;Grade A! Rapturous Laughter! Two and a half
  hours of constant smiles!&rdquo; Time Out raves, &ldquo;Good Gosh!
  It&rsquo;s big, joyous musical fun!&rdquo; And <em>Variety</em> declares,
  &ldquo;this irresistible musical turns the most skeptical curmudgeon into
  a walking heart-eye emoji.&rdquo;<br /><br />From <em>Saturday Night
  Live</em>&rsquo;s Lorne Michaels, <em>Schmigadoon!</em> is directed by
  Tony Award winner Christopher Gattelli (<em>Newsies</em>, <em>Death
  Becomes Her</em>), with a Tony Award-winning book and Tony- and Emmy&reg;
  Award-winning score by Cinco Paul (<em>Despicable Me</em>, <em>The Secret
  Life of Pets</em>).</p>
END:VEVENT
